 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "gives the same numbers for the points of the distance matrix ",
 StyleBox["m", "TI"],
 "."
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"870cb3bf-3cb0-4097-9805-c02ae0b02265"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Definition: with ",
 StyleBox["e", "TI"],
 "(",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 ") the eccentricity of ",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["GraphEccentricities"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/GraphEccentricities", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "0b3223cb-ec39-4dcf-889c-9535ad361232"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["r", "TI"],
 " the radius and ",
 StyleBox["D", "TI"],
 " the diameter of ",
 StyleBox["g", "TI"],
 ", the relative eccentricity is ",
 StyleBox["t", "TI"],
 "(",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 ") = (",
 StyleBox["e", "TI"],
 "(",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 ") \[Minus] ",
 StyleBox["r", "TI"],
 ")/(",
 StyleBox["D", "TI"],
 " \[Minus] ",
 StyleBox["r", "TI"],
 "). It runs from 0 exactly on the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["GraphCenter"]], "paclet:ref/GraphCenter"},
   "RefLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "13597466-ac0a-4e78-bea7-794272ba899b"],
 " to 1 exactly on the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["GraphPeriphery"]], "paclet:ref/GraphPeriphery"},
   "RefLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "55d65371-1f06-410b-a806-59fb956b1a02"],
 "."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"8fb02c42-8146-4f6e-b314-73dd665412ed"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "On a graph the eccentricity is an integer, so ",
 StyleBox["t", "TI"],
 " takes at most ",
 StyleBox["D", "TI"],
 " \[Minus] ",
 StyleBox["r", "TI"],
 " + 1 values, 0, 1/(",
 StyleBox["D", "TI"],
 " \[Minus] ",
 StyleBox["r", "TI"],
 "), \[Ellipsis], 1. The sets {",
 StyleBox["t", "TI"],
 " \[LessEqual] ",
 StyleBox["q", "TI"],
 "} are nested, and each holds the centre."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"26d16235-03e3-4e9e-b269-7fa7522a362f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "When ",
 StyleBox["D", "TI"],
 " = ",
 StyleBox["r", "TI"],
 ", as on a vertex-transitive graph, and on a graph with several components, \
every value is 0."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"ea2cb988-90bd-45ea-a1c0-ddbe9fc7f31e"]
}, Open  ]],

